{"3608430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ultima Nex", "steam_appid": 3608430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Campaign Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete many different missions in Campaign Mode and save the space city from the pirates!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your class - Dominate the battlefield</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ultima Nex, you duel with other players in action-packed space battles. Choose from five unique spaceship classes, each designed for different play styles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔺<strong>Fighter</strong> - The perfect all-rounder, relatively fast, good damage and good defence!<br>🔺<strong>Fighter Jet</strong> - The fastest ship in the galaxy! Particularly annoying against any kind of ship, except...<br>🔺<strong>Interceptor</strong> - Particularly good against small, fast spaceships, with lots of small projectiles being fired at the same time!<br>🔺<strong>Battery</strong> - Nerve your opponents with large EMP waves that paralyse all players in the vicinity!<br>🔺<strong>Heavy Cannon</strong> - This spaceship has an extremely large cannon with it, which does immense damage and is therefore particularly good against tanks<br>🔺<strong>Shadow Hunter</strong> - A fast, annoying assassin, he is designed to surprise his opponents and eliminate them quickly</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Different special abilities for each spaceship</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each spaceship has special abilities that offer different strategic possibilities to conquer the galaxy!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game modes - Your path to galaxy domination</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultima Nex offers various exciting game modes that provide excitement and variety:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔺<strong>Deathmatch</strong> - Fight against the other team, but beware! There is no respawning! <br>🔺<strong>Space War</strong> - Fight against the other team, the team that defeats more opponents wins <br>🔺<strong>Core Defence</strong> - Protect your energy core, only it will allow you to respawn. Destroy the enemy team's core and then eliminate it completely, and victory is yours...<br>🔺<strong>Space Conquerors</strong> - Capture all of your opponent's space zones and defend your own!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A vast galaxy awaits you</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From dense asteroid fields to abandoned space stations and huge planetary rings - every map in Ultima Nex brings new challenges and strategic opportunities. Use the terrain to your advantage, lay ambushes or flee into dangerous nebula clouds to escape your opponents.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Campaign Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete many different missions in Campaign Mode and save the space city from the pirates!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your class - Dominate the battlefield</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ultima Nex, you duel with other players in action-packed space battles. Choose from five unique spaceship classes, each designed for different play styles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔺<strong>Fighter</strong> - The perfect all-rounder, relatively fast, good damage and good defence!<br>🔺<strong>Fighter Jet</strong> - The fastest ship in the galaxy! Particularly annoying against any kind of ship, except...<br>🔺<strong>Interceptor</strong> - Particularly good against small, fast spaceships, with lots of small projectiles being fired at the same time!<br>🔺<strong>Battery</strong> - Nerve your opponents with large EMP waves that paralyse all players in the vicinity!<br>🔺<strong>Heavy Cannon</strong> - This spaceship has an extremely large cannon with it, which does immense damage and is therefore particularly good against tanks<br>🔺<strong>Shadow Hunter</strong> - A fast, annoying assassin, he is designed to surprise his opponents and eliminate them quickly</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Different special abilities for each spaceship</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each spaceship has special abilities that offer different strategic possibilities to conquer the galaxy!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game modes - Your path to galaxy domination</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultima Nex offers various exciting game modes that provide excitement and variety:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔺<strong>Deathmatch</strong> - Fight against the other team, but beware! There is no respawning! <br>🔺<strong>Space War</strong> - Fight against the other team, the team that defeats more opponents wins <br>🔺<strong>Core Defence</strong> - Protect your energy core, only it will allow you to respawn. Destroy the enemy team's core and then eliminate it completely, and victory is yours...<br>🔺<strong>Space Conquerors</strong> - Capture all of your opponent's space zones and defend your own!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A vast galaxy awaits you</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From dense asteroid fields to abandoned space stations and huge planetary rings - every map in Ultima Nex brings new challenges and strategic opportunities. Use the terrain to your advantage, lay ambushes or flee into dangerous nebula clouds to escape your opponents.</p>", "short_description": "Become the master of the galaxy! Battle solo or team up with others in intense multiplayer fights. Conquer the galaxy across diverse modes and maps!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Russian, Ukrainian, Swedish, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608430/1609dfa9fa6b803d8f7cc765795566028596ec08/header.jpg?t=1775822611", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608430/cc2d6dcef05901b767693d35b6084acafeb4f8d4/capsule_231x87.j